			"Message": "CQ: Fix compilation errors and unnecessary mut in Air\n\n- Add cfg guards for platform-specific methods in Daemon (Windows)\n- Add cfg guards for platform-specific methods in Updates (Windows, Linux features)\n- Remove unnecessary mut in Updates/CancelDownload\n- Fix invalid await on non-future in Binary.rs shutdown code\n- Drop unused JoinHandle results in Binary.rs startup\n\nThis fixes CQ-32 (unnecessary mut in Air) and resolves compilation errors\ncaused by platform-specific methods being called without cfg guards.",
